# Ollama Modelfile for local EEVE GGUF
#
# How to change the GGUF path:
#   - Replace the path in FROM with your local GGUF file location.
# How to adjust temperature and context window:
#   - Edit the PARAMETER lines below.
# How this SYSTEM block complements rulebook.md:
#   - This enforces JSON-only output at the model level; rulebook.md repeats the rule.

FROM ./eeve-10.8b.Q4_K_M.gguf

PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096

SYSTEM """
You must respond with exactly one JSON object wrapped by a ```json code fence.
For days 1–6: { "day", "delta", "score", "reason", "llm_summary" }.
For day 7: { "day": 7, "final_score", "final_grade", "risk_report":[], "next_recommendations":[] }.
No extra text before or after the JSON block.
"""

